sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant W as Welcome
  participant L as Log in
  participant P as Forgot password
  participant G as Sign up
  participant S as Server
  participant R as Role Home
  U->>W: 1: Open the app
  W->>S: 2: GET /health (connect)
  S-->>W: 3: Server ready
  alt Log in
    U->>W: 4: Tap Log in
    W->>L: 5: Open Log in
    U->>L: 6: Phone number and password, tap Log in
    L->>S: 7: POST /api/auth/login
    alt Details correct
      S-->>L: 8: Token and role
      L->>R: 9: Open the tabs of the role (Owner, Staff, Rider, Customer)
    else Details wrong
      S-->>L: 10: 400 Details wrong
      L-->>U: 11: Red message, fields marked
    end
  else Forgot password
    U->>L: 12: Tap Forgot password
    L->>P: 13: Open Forgot password
    U->>P: 14: Email, then 6-digit code, then new password
    P->>S: 15: POST /api/auth/forgot, /forgot/verify, /forgot/reset
    S-->>P: 16: Password changed
    P->>L: 17: Back to Log in
  else Sign up (customers)
    U->>W: 18: Tap Sign up
    W->>G: 19: Open Sign up
    U->>G: 20: Name, phone, email, password, agree to terms
    G->>S: 21: POST /api/auth/signup
    S-->>G: 22: Account created and token
    G->>R: 23: Open Customer Home
  else Continue as guest
    U->>W: 24: Tap Continue as guest
    W->>R: 25: Open Customer Home (guest code saved on the phone)
  end
